4. Representatives of CVETs increased their knowledge about usage and further development of the Moodle platform
5. IDPs and other conflict-affected people participated in the short-term vocational course 
6. Methodological recommendations and requirements regarding the content and the maintenance of the created platform 
have been developed and transferred to SES and CVETs</narrative>
